@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Invalid input: check-shortfall cal/0
autonumber

actor User
participant "MishMash" as App
participant "parser: Parser" as Parser
participant "targetParser:\nCheckShortfallParser" as TargetParser

User -> App : check-shortfall cal/0
App -> Parser : parseCommand(input)
activate Parser
note over Parser : Dispatch to parseCheckShortfall(arguments).
create TargetParser
Parser -> TargetParser : new CheckShortfallParser()
Parser -> TargetParser : parse("cal/0")
activate TargetParser
TargetParser -> TargetParser : readTarget("cal/0", values)
TargetParser -> TargetParser : parseTarget("0", "cal")
TargetParser --> Parser : throws IllegalArgumentException
deactivate TargetParser
note right of Parser
  Catch the validation error and create
  MishMashException with the usage
  instructions and original cause.
end note
Parser --> App : throws MishMashException
deactivate Parser
App -> App : displayError(exception)
App --> User : Error message and check-shortfall format
note over App : After executeCommand returns to readCommands:
App -> App : displayCommandPrompt()
App --> User : Divider and next command prompt
note over Parser, TargetParser
  No CheckShortfallCommand or NutritionTargets is created.
  No plan, recipe, or grocery data is read or changed.
end note
@enduml
